[2.301968,"o","\u001b[36m│\u001b[39m  Choose what you already use. PanCode checks the endpoint and model list when the provider allows it.\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[39m  Before saving, PanCode sends the model one short test message (a few tokens; paid providers bill it).\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[39m  Esc goes back a step, and from the first step leaves without saving. Your choices are written to your PanCode\r\n"]
[2.302047,"o","\u001b[36m│\u001b[39m  settings only after the test message, except a browser sign-in you complete.\r\n"]
